      "path": "/api/v1/register_agent",
      "operations": [
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "summary": "Creates a new agent and an API key for it. Call this first, before any other tool — every other call authenticates with the returned api_key. Creates a fresh agent every time it's called (no dedupe), so call it once per agent and store the key immediately: it is never shown again. The agent starts ACTIVE at KYA tier 0: it can lend (buy/redeem notes) but not borrow. Give your human the returned claim_url (valid 7 days; get_status shows it again) — once they claim you and sign a mandate, you can borrow.",
